#!/usr/bin/env bash
# List developer commands available in this repo.
cat <<'TXT'
Developer commands (scripts/ is on PATH via .envrc):

  run [path]            Build the UI and backend and run the app (release);
                        an optional path opens that Engine library
  help                  Show this list

Cargo shortcuts:

  cargo build           Build the UI and the backend (both are needed to run)
  cargo run             Run the UI (debug); build the backend first
  cargo test --workspace  Run all tests (UI, backend, gRPC end to end)
  cargo check           Type-check
  cargo clippy          Lint
  cargo fmt             Format

Nix:

  nix flake check       Validate the flake
  nix flake update      Update pinned inputs
TXT
